+  # ⏱ ADDED 2026-10-01 (O-STORE-BUILD-SYMBOLS-EXPIRE-AT-90-DAYS, review AA-07). A tag's builds are the
+  # ones that ship — the apps.gov.in .apk a person uploads from the Release above all — and their
+  # symbols lived only in the 90-day `symbols-<app>-*` artifacts. This copies each symbols directory to
+  # the private R2 release store (tooling/channel-register.json releaseStore) BEFORE the Release exists:
+  # `release` needs this job. A job of its own, not steps of `release`: limbs 1b/1c of
+  # assert-release-durable.mjs read every download in a publishing job as published, and the mappings
+  # must never be. On a non-tag run every step is skipped and the job is green, so `release` still runs.
